      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As part of a new direction for Stitch, we’re introducing a new experiment, Stitch Loop: a long-running product agent that connects to your codebase and live metrics to continuously improve what you’ve shipped.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We are introducing Stitch Loop, a product agent that connects to your codebase and live metrics to continuously optimize your software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We are introducing Stitch Loop, a new tool from Google Labs that helps you maintain and improve your software after it launches.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are introducing Stitch Loop, a long-running product agent from Google Labs that connects to your codebase and live metrics, finds what needs fixing, and keeps working 24/7 on your product until your goals are met.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Together, Stitch and Stitch Loop are steps toward our broader ambition for Stitch: creating agents to help lean teams tackle the hardest parts of creating great products from ideation through continuous optimization.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Build: Once you choose a direction, Stitch Loop writes the code in an isolated cloud sandbox and opens a GitHub pull request for your approval.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Stitch Loop includes a dedicated security loop that pairs Gemini 4 Carbon's cyber security capabilities with CodeMender , Google DeepMind's autonomous agent that improves code security.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Whatever coding agent you prefer can pull persistent product context from Stitch Loop via the Stitch CLI and MCP to power mixed-model setups and fully autonomous improvements in your existing workflow.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T18:50:59.213Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Stitch Loop waitlist opens today for all users, globally, with eligible Google AI Ultra users getting priority access.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/stitch-loop/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
